Package: local-step-viewer
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: all
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Maintainer: STEP Viewer <step-viewer@localhost>
Depends: python3, python3-pyqt5, python3-vtk9, python3-numpy, libqt5svg5, freecad-python3, shared-mime-info
Description: Native desktop viewer for STEP and STP models
 Displays local CAD files using Qt, VTK and FreeCAD, with a bundled
 F330 assembly preview and per-component visibility controls.
